# Task Compass Compatibility Alias

This Skill preserves existing `route-openclaw-task` invocations. New workflows should use `task-compass`.

Run the bundled router from this compatibility directory:

```bash
python3 scripts/route_task.py --goal "<task>" --pretty
```

Treat its JSON as advisory policy input. Preserve `deny`, `await_human`, `replan`, `refuse`, explicit read-only boundaries, and `safety_guard=true`. Runtime permissions remain authoritative.

Read [references/routing-contract.md](references/routing-contract.md) for the stable schema and [references/model-card.md](references/model-card.md) for provenance and limitations.
